{"id": "tea:yogakundali-upanisad:3.33-34", "source": "src:yogakundali-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "3.33-34"}, "paraphrase": "Such a one is liberated while living; when the body falls he attains bodiless liberation, like the wind becoming still.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["karma-liberation"], "concepts": ["cpt:jivanmukti", "cpt:videhamukti"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "sourced", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": [{"phase": "C", "date": "2026-09-29", "method": "text-locate", "queries": ["e-text yogakundali-upanisad 3.33-34"], "evidence": ["catalog:raw_etexts:108_Upanishads", "text:sources_raw/raw_etexts/vedaH/misc/upaniShat/mixedPF/108_Upanishads.md"], "result": "confirmed", "note": "E-text 3.33-34 located; the passage matches the paraphrase (it begins: 'dhyāyannāste muniścai-vamāsupterāmṛtestu yaḥ | jīvanmuktaḥ sa vijñeyaḥ sa dhanyaḥ kṛtakṛtyavān || 33…').", "by": "sourcing:U04-minor-upanisads"}]}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
